  m_text: "Push nut       with      to goal      to score and reduce goal count.
    When goal count reaches 0, level is Completed!\nBeware! Not all interactions
    will reduce goal count!\nWhen you miss moved you can always use Undo to return.
    Undo works until last goal score position. \nYou can always restart the level
    if you think that squirrels wont survive the winter by starving or by any other
    excuse! "
